            </note>
            <note corresp="#d10-f3" n="11" xml:id="d10-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed. The final report of the Tariff Commission was printed as <hi
                        rendition="#italic">The Effects of the Cuban Reciprocity Treaty of 1902</hi>
                    (Washington, Government Printing Office, 1929).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
